///                                    * When clear, the region is not checked
///                                    * (P)
///                                    ###
///               %unsigned 1  Lock                      0x0
///                                    ###
///                                    * When set, locks the registers associated with this region
///                                    * (REGION_MST_CFG, REGION_SADDR, REGION_EADDR, REGION_CTRL). Once
///                                    * set, may only be cleared by a reset
///                                    * (P)
///                                    ###
///               %unsigned 1  NS                        0x0
